     "passage": "Troupe Master - Aeldari (Infantry Character)\nSource: Aeldari (edition 11, v1.3)\nModel Troupe Master: M 8\" T 3 Sv 6+ inv 4+ W 4 Ld 6+ OC 1 base 25mm\nComposition: 1 Troupe Master\nWargear Fusion pistol (Ranged): Range 6 A 1 BS 2 S 8 AP -4 D D6 - assault, melta 2, pistol\nWargear Neuro disruptor (Ranged): Range 12 A 1 BS 2 S 4 AP -2 D 1 - anti-infantry 2+, assault, pistol\nWargear Shuriken pistol (Ranged): Range 12 A 1 BS 2 S 4 AP -1 D 1 - assault, pistol\nWargear Harlequin’s special weapon (Melee): A 6 WS 2 S 4 AP -1 D 2 - devastating wounds\nWargear Troupe Master’s blade (Melee): A 5 WS 2 S 5 AP -2 D 2 - devastating wounds\nOption: This model’s shuriken pistol can be replaced with one of the following: 1 fusion pistol 1 neuro disruptor\nOption: This model's Troupe Master's blade can be replaced with 1 Harlequin's special weapon.\nPoints: 1 model 75 pts\n\n- faction: faction-ae"
