     "short": "Change to: ‘That model has the INFANTRY/BEASTS/SWARM keyword and is within a terrain area that contains one or more light/dense terrain features .’ 13.10 Obscuring Terrain areas containing one or more light or dense terrain features are obscuring terrain areas.",
